OL,3,GNEWSACouncil U-turn on children's
OL,4,Anursing cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FProposals to remove community staff
OL,7,Fnurses from the health visiting
OL,8,Fservices in Suffolk have been reversed,
OL,9,Fbut cuts to school nursing and support
OL,10,Ffor teenage parents will go ahead.
OL,12,FSuffolk County Council said it wanted
OL,13,Fto make changes to how children's
OL,14,Fcommunity nursing was provided, as the
OL,15,Fcurrent model was not financially
OL,16,Fviable.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
