OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil U-turn on children's
OL,4,Anursing cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnison's Eastern Regional Organiser
OL,7,FCameron Matthews said: "The council has
OL,8,Flistened to the public on keeping
OL,9,Fnurses in its health visiting team, but
OL,10,Fignored overwhelming opposition to
OL,11,Fevery other aspect of its plans."
OL,13,FJune Mummery, the Reform UK-led
OL,14,Fcouncil's cabinet member for public
OL,15,Fhealth, said: "I pushed hard for us to
OL,16,Flook again at the proposals and find
OL,17,Fanother way forward."
